{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29434","headline":"隋宫 · 李商隐","name":"隋宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘兴南游不戒严，九重谁省谏书函。\n春风举国裁宫锦，半作障泥半作帆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“隋宫”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“隋宫”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}